[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7383.59, "timestamp": "02:03:03", "text": "他像蝴蝶一样翩翩起舞。哦，留下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7400.589, "timestamp": "02:03:20", "text": "男。好吧，你知道吗？我们走吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7403.99, "timestamp": "02:03:23", "text": "在。你最喜欢的非维迪卡里安人是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7405.95, "timestamp": "02:03:25", "text": "食物？哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7408.31, "timestamp": "02:03:28", "text": "非暴力。那就像肉类之类的东西，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7411.83, "timestamp": "02:03:31", "text": "哦好的。嗯，看起来很危险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7414.709, "timestamp": "02:03:34", "text": "岌岌可危。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7418.229, "timestamp": "02:03:38", "text": "我往下掉。别无他法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7420.75, "timestamp": "02:03:40", "text": "呃，非素食。我没有多少。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7423.07, "timestamp": "02:03:43", "text": "最爱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7431.189, "timestamp": "02:03:51", "text": "任何事物。任何事物。只要是食物就行。"}]